            "review_title": "Review at Buratino Pizza",
            "review_text": "Ella Ruth\n48 contributions\n0\nCheap and yum\nMar 2020 • Couples\nThe prices are low and the food is good, even if portion sizes are a little small - typical for Vietnam tho. The staff here are LOVELY and try there best to help with whatever they can. The second time we went there they were confronted with 2 horrible sets of customers (one a family with older children who threw pizza crusts and food scraps all over the floor, and another an older American man who gave them a hard time for speaking minimal English - despite him not speaking any Vietnamese!) so credit for them for handling that so calmly. A good place if you’re craving western food amongst the street food of Quy Nhon.\nRead more\nWritten March 4, 2020",
            "rating": 5.0,
