            "review_title": "Review at Buratino Pizza",
            "review_text": "Nadine\nHanoi, Vietnam29 contributions\n1\nOver priced and poor quality\nJan 2020 • Couples\nWe ordered two portions of fried and two pizzas (one without cheese). The fries were 25k each but each portion only had a small handful of chips - and they were coated in a cheese powder. Then came the pizzas - a large was 195k and again the smallest pizza for a (large) that I've ever seen. However, only one pizza came, as opposed to the two that we ordered. When we asked for the bill it came with a 30% Tet service charge. Happy to pay holiday additional charges, but there was no notice of this or signposting. Also 30% was the highest that we encountered.\nRead more\nWritten January 28, 2020",
            "rating": 5.0,
