            "review_title": "Review at Buratino Pizza",
            "review_text": "BokJohn\nQuy Nhon, Vietnam15 contributions\n0\nGood Pizza and Pasta\nMay 2018 • Family\nService was very good. Waitress explained the dishes and combinations. Food arrived in a timely manner and was served hot. Everything required for eating the meal was brought by the waitress without having to ask, enough plates, silverware, napkins and condiments. The food was tasty. The crust on the pizza was fully baked and very tasteful. The Spaghetti and Pasta with the Cream sauce was very good. Management and the waitress checked with us throughout the meal to see if everything was alright and if we needed anything.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 19, 2018",
