            "review_text": "Penny Z\n28 contributions\n0\nDecent enough\nNov 2017 • Friends\nThe pizza was alright, not exactly Western standard but pretty good for Vietnam circumstances. And the prices are alright as well :) also service was really good, I accidentally dropped the boiling hot pizza on my leg and the floor and they offered to make me a new one straight away and gave me wet tissues for my legs, even though it was clearly my fault. I don't really get why people are complaining about the size in other reviews. The menu clearly says the size in cm so what do you guys expect? Pictures of the menu and the size of the small pizza in comparison to my hand attached(pictures uploaded on the 5. Of November)\nRead more\nWritten November 5, 2017",
